isam|Developer tools|Softfocus ISAM, an indexed-sequential file demonstration.|The forum disk lists it as public domain, but its own documentation says it no longer is and is sold.|EFFO forum disk 2
jive|Amusements|A text filter that rewrites English in a comic dialect.|Left out on content. valspeak, from the same posting, ships.|comp.sources.games v01i003
